    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a systematic review screener.\n\nYour task is to screen research papers based on inclusion criteria.\n\nCRITERIA:\n\n* C1: Uses deep learning or machine learning\n* C2: Involves medical images\n* C3: About classification or diagnosis\n* C4: Presents a method (not a survey/review/editorial)\n\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\n\nAbstract: {{ $json.abstract }}\n\nIMPORTANT RULES:\n\n* Return ONLY raw valid JSON\n* Do NOT use markdown\n* Do NOT use ```json\n* Do NOT explain anything outside JSON\n* confidence must be a number between 0 and 1\n* criteria_matched must be an array\n\nReturn EXACTLY in this format:\n\n{\n\"decision\": \"Include\",\n\"confidence\": 0.85,\n\"reason\": \"Short one sentence explanation.\",\n\"criteria_matched\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"]\n}\n",
        "options": {}
